    <!-- lameta-source {"folderType":"session","folderId":"INT_2018_0033","fieldKey":"description"} -->
    <Description>Kalani Søndergaard talks about why the frame is the real work. Halfway through, a visitor asked whether the work was finished. It was not clear that the question had an answer.</Description>
